                "title_zh": "厦门海沧半程马拉松",
                "title_en": "Half-marathon in Haicang， Xiamen， Fujian",
                "date": "2023-12-03",
                "tags_zh": [
                    "半马"
                ],
                "tags_en": [
                    "Half-marathon"
                ],
                "content_zh": "1：40：42\n第一次半程马拉松。经验不足，在配速和补给上没有做充分的准备，20km处已经出现轻微肌肉痉挛。由于起跑区域差也影响了发挥。或许当时真实实力能达到1：35：00。",
                "content_en": "1:40:42\nMy first half marathon. Due to a lack of experience, I didn't make adequate preparations in terms of pace and supplies. I had already experienced mild muscle spasms at the 20-kilometer mark. The performance was also affected because the starting area was far back. Perhaps the actual strength at that time could have reached 1:35:00.",
